  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For real roots,&nbsp;</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; ...(i)<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; ...(ii)<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; ...(iii)</p><p>If <math><mi>q</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then (ii)&nbsp;is always true.<br />If <math><mi>q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then (i)&nbsp;and&nbsp;(iii) are always true.<br />So, the equation has atleast two real roots.</p>"
